Description: Anthropic's Claude Code, on your device
 Ask for a change in plain language and Claude reads your files, writes the code
 and runs the commands to make it happen. Run `claude` in a terminal and sign in
 with your Claude account or an API key. This is an unofficial packaging of
 Anthropic's own build; the software inside stays under Anthropic's licence and
 terms.
